    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A racing game truly like no other. Faster, tighter and more challenging than anything before it, Fluid Drift seeks to refresh the genre; giving racers something new that will push them further. With simple, stunning visuals and a beat-laden soundtrack, this game will make you rethink what you know about how to race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid Drift is about feel. Fluid Drift is about flow. It's about hitting that one single perfect line faster than your brain can think yet somehow doing it without thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The pinnacle of drift racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piloting a drift craft is no easy feat - you'll need to have impeccable timing and incredible reflexes to progress.\u00a0 Controlled either by controller or mouse and keyboard, Fluid Drift handles more closely to a space-based dog-fighting game than a traditional racer.\u00a0 Yet the tracks themselves are truly unforgiving - with incredibly tight sections that are almost puzzle-like.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A racing game truly like no other. Faster, tighter and more challenging than anything before it, Fluid Drift seeks to refresh the genre; giving racers something new that will push them further. With simple, stunning visuals and a beat-laden soundtrack, this game will make you rethink what you know about how to race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid Drift is about feel. Fluid Drift is about flow. It's about hitting that one single perfect line faster than your brain can think yet somehow doing it without thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The pinnacle of drift racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piloting a drift craft is no easy feat - you'll need to have impeccable timing and incredible reflexes to progress.\u00a0 Controlled either by controller or mouse and keyboard, Fluid Drift handles more closely to a space-based dog-fighting game than a traditional racer.\u00a0 Yet the tracks themselves are truly unforgiving - with incredibly tight sections that are almost puzzle-like.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Fluid Drift is a unique, super-fast, super-technical sci-fi racing game.\u00a0 Experience edge-of-control racing by piloting ultra-manoeuvrable craft through deceptively tricky courses surrounding a long abandoned planet.Challenge yourself, push your abilities and find the perfect flow.",
